WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:06.375
Destiny...

00:00:07.166 --> 00:00:10.083
helps people believe there's an
order to this horseshit.

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:12.208
There isn’t.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.250
You don't believe in destiny...

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.750
or the lesser evil.

00:00:19.708 --> 00:00:21.375
What do you believe in?

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:24.458
The girl...

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:26.708
in the woods will be with you always.

00:00:34.541 --> 00:00:36.500
You saved my life.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.958
I must repay you.

00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:39.250
I...

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.666
claim the tradition as you have.

00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:44.250
The law of surprise.

00:00:44.625 --> 00:00:46.708
Destiny can go f...

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.791
What have you done Witcher?

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.416
You're bound to this now Geralt,

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:56.875
whether you like it or not.

00:00:57.875 --> 00:01:01.333
You lecture me on made up cures
for having a child,

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:04.333
meanwhile you cheat
with destiny to steal one.

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:09.125
You can't outrun destiny just
because you're terrified of it,

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:11.833
it’s coming, Geralt.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.833
I can’t sleep.

00:01:13.833 --> 00:01:17.750
You will try to outrun the girl
in the woods but you cannot.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.500
Why would I give my only heir

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.500
to someone who never cared
enough to come back for her?

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:30.666
Find Geralt of Rivia...

00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:33.166
he is your destiny.

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.833
If you dismiss it...

00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:40.916
you will surely unleash...

00:01:40.916 --> 00:01:42.541
true calamity...

00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:44.500
upon us all.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.541
Where is Cirilla?

00:01:51.541 --> 00:01:53.583
I have to find my destiny.

00:01:54.291 --> 00:01:56.375
She is your destiny.

00:01:58.208 --> 00:02:03.666
The bond that will come in to being
between you and this child

00:02:03.666 --> 00:02:05.791
will be extraordinary.

